10:    Hover/focus: num+label blaze + shift 16px (12 mobile) â€” shift
11:    sÃ³ com motion ok (comp: "hover de cor mantido" no reduced).
12:    Linha vertical decorativa: stroke line-dark 1.5, nodes
13:    hairline-dark (D1 â€” aposenta os cinzas ad hoc da comp), pulso
14:    blaze halo r9 + dot r4 via transform (comp usa SMIL sÃ³ como
15:    preview â€” Â§4); some no reduced (linha 100% desenhada, L5).
16:    Entrada: fade+slide 0.4s var(--ease) + stagger 40ms/item,
17:    gated (L10/L5 â€” reduced aparece sem transiÃ§Ã£o).
18:    Meta: mono 12 steel caps +0.08em (L12), alvos â‰¥44px,
19:    [CONFIRMAR] steel (L1). Foco: circuit (L3). Sem drop-shadow
20:    (L9). Mobile 375: padding 24/20/40 Â· label 38px Â· meta coluna.
21:    ============================================================ */
